              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ahtumwynd"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Love this soup! 64oz low sodium V8, bag of frozen mixed veggies and a potato and you have an awesome soup. Have made this over and over again and never get tired of it.",
            "datePublished": "2010-04-25T11:22:45.780Z"
