              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "LivelyLime2816"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I'm not fond of ground meat so I excluded it, added more veggies instead. The additional potatoes made it feel really hearty, hearty enough to keep you full for hours. Baked a loaf of fresh bread and had one yummy of a good time! Reminded me of the canned ABC's and 123's soup I had as a child.",
