            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mizb"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Second time I have made this soup. I added my own spice mixture and plenty of onion. I used V8 juice instead of tomato, along with beef bone broth and vegetable broth. Also added sliced mushrooms. Serve with garlic toast and a small salad and you have a very satisfying, filling meal! I cooked the ground beef separately as there is a vegetarian among us.",
            "datePublished": "2025-10-15T23:00:59.027Z"
