            "reviewBody": "Like many others I been making this for over 60 years and for the most part I do use most of this as is, BUT! I use a lot more onion, garlic, onion powder, garlic powder, some red pepper, a couple of bay leaves, a little bit of hot sauce, more veggies. Sever with corn bread, and don't come telling me about putting sugar in cornbread. sugar does not belong in cornbread. Enjoy",
